### Get all payments
GET http://localhost:5500/api/payments

### Get payment by id
GET http://localhost:5500/api/payments/payment-001

### Create payment
POST http://localhost:5500/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "enrollmentId": "enroll-004",
    "amount": 10000,
    "paymentMethod": "mobile-money",
    "transactionReference": "MM-20260913-001"
}

### Update payment
PUT http://localhost:5500/api/payments/payment-004
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "completed"
}

### Delete payment
DELETE http://localhost:5500/api/payments/payment-005